/farmland-atlas/nebraska/scotts-bluff-county"],["ARC or PLC in Scotts Bluff County","/arc-plc/nebraska/scotts-bluff-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, February to March came in under 90% of normal in 39 of the 75 years from 1951 to 2025 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids. So far in 2026 the county&rsquo;s middle value ran 34% of normal in March to April and 44% in April to May. Every grid had its driest year in 2012, down to 42% of normal on grid 26206.</p>"}
